<title>UK: One Brent date kept, the other clocked - trade.</title>
<headline>One Brent date kept, the other clocked - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>One Brent cargo due to be nominated from the paper chain on Tuesday was kept by British Petroleum and the other was five o'clocked to J.P. Morgan, traders said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8145</p>
</text>
